		(at 228.3 52 90)
		(descr "Universal 2-pole PCB terminal block pad pattern for 5.0 mm AND 5.08 mm pitch parts: pads at 5.04 mm (outer pins off by at most 0.04 mm), drill 1.3 mm, oval pads 1.8 x 3.0 mm (3.24 mm gap: meets the 3 mm mains rule). Fits e.g. Phoenix Contact MKDS 1,5/2-5,08, PT 1,5/2-5,0-H, WAGO 236-102, generic 5.0 mm screw terminals. Courtyard covers the WAGO 236 (largest). +Y = wire entry side.")
